  "description": "OEDRO Rear Bumper is made with 5/32\" stamped steel sheets that bolster the strength of the weight-bearing region, This Bumper is winch compatible. Direct installation with no cutting or drilling required. The Jeep Wrangler JK Bumper is able to tow either 2,000 pounds or 3,500 pounds depending on the configuration you choose. Most two-door models have a tow rating of up to 2,000 pounds, while most 4-door models are able to tow 3,500 pounds.\nFeatures\nSpare Tire Mount Allowed. Enough space for a spare tire up to a 35-inch one.\n2'' Receiver Hitch. A 2-inch trailer hitch makes an easy attachment point for towing your racks, suitcases, bicycle, cargo carriers, etc.\nNo Drilling Installation. No-drilling installation uses factory mounting points with no relocation required.\nAll-Weather Guard. The Bumper is also powder-coated with a black textured finish, By pre-treatment to provide extreme resistance against rust and wear.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nFits for 2007-2018 Jeep Wrangler JK & JK Unlimited 2-Door & 4-Door All Models\nNote: The shackle is not designed for towing and recovery, refer to the owner's manual for towing and rescue information. Overload is not included in after-sales service.",
